      <dependency task="060" status="pending">Server-side deep-links already repointed; keeps client + server on the same sprk_spaarkeai shape.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-039">SCOPE: repointed client launches call openSpaarkeAi (sprk_spaarkeai deep-link in code); record-driven opens MUST NOT route through surfaceLaunchRegistry.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">SCOPE: only the surviving launch callers (sprk_analysis form/ribbon command, PlaybookLibrary navigateTo) are repointed; the dead custom-page branch (sprk_analysisworkspace_8bc0b) is removed. Do NOT delete the AnalysisWorkspace source tree here (that is task 063) — only edit the launcher shim if it still gates a surviving caller.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">SCOPE: ordered §13.5 — this repoint MUST be complete before the web-resource/tree deletion in 063; no deletion of web resources in this task.</constraint>
