  <steps mode="prescriptive">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor declaration">Load knowledge files; declare STANDARD rigor + reason; confirm 052 + 060 merged.</step>
    <step order="1">Read launch-resolver.ts openSpaarkeAi to capture the client-side sprk_spaarkeai navigate shape.</step>
    <step order="2">In sprk_analysis_commands.js, repoint Spaarke_OpenAnalysisWorkspace (lines ~145-169, ~213-235) to call openSpaarkeAi (sprk_spaarkeai) with analysisId/regarding context.</step>
    <step order="3">Remove the dead custom-page path near line ~549 that targets sprk_analysisworkspace_8bc0b (unreferenced/dead branch).</step>
    <step order="4">Repoint PlaybookLibrary main.tsx (~234-245): change navigateTo webresourceName sprk_AnalysisWorkspace to openSpaarkeAi (sprk_spaarkeai).</step>
    <step order="5">Inspect sprk_AnalysisWorkspaceLauncher.js — if it only bootstraps the retiring code page (deleted in 063) and no surviving caller depends on it, leave it for 063's deletion; do NOT repoint it to keep the dead page alive.</step>
    <step order="6">Build the affected client bundles (PlaybookLibrary; SpaarkeAi if touched); Grep client JS/TS for sprk_analysisworkspace / sprk_AnalysisWorkspace / sprk_analysisworkspace_8bc0b and confirm the only remaining hits are inside the AnalysisWorkspace tree that 063 deletes.</step>
    <step order="7">Update TASK-INDEX.md: set task 061 status to ✅.</step>
    <step order="8">Document any deviation in projects/ai-advanced-capabilities-analysis-hub-r1/notes/.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
