  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the sprk_analysis form ribbon/OnLoad launcher fires, when it opens the analysis surface, then it navigates to sprk_spaarkeai via openSpaarkeAi carrying analysisId/regarding (not sprk_analysisworkspace).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the PlaybookLibrary launch, when invoked, then it opens sprk_spaarkeai via openSpaarkeAi (not navigateTo webresourceName sprk_AnalysisWorkspace).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The dead custom-page path (sprk_analysisworkspace_8bc0b) is removed from sprk_analysis_commands.js.</criterion>
